        "message": "Rebuild marketing/ as an agent-ready posting automation reference\n\nRefocused on what was asked: every platform's upload capabilities, whether\nit has an API, whether the API is free, and every way to automate posting.\nRemoved the ad and crypto-promotion material (CRYPTO-CHANNELS.md,\nCOMPLIANCE.md).\n\n- 71 platforms (was 29): adds video (Vimeo, Dailymotion, PeerTube…),\n  blogs and creative (WordPress, Blogger, Ghost, Flickr, SoundCloud…),\n  regional (VK, Weibo, WeChat, Douyin, LINE, Kakao, Viber…) and others\n- data/platforms.json: per-platform automation_options, best first\n  (official API, user sign-in, scheduler, Siri Shortcut, native, manual)\n- LOGIN.md: posting on a user's behalf after they sign in; Google sign-in\n  only covers Google services; scopes, reviews, token lifetimes\n- AGENT-GUIDE.md: what an agent asks the user, how it picks a route, setup\n  patterns and rules\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019dLaQpC8ustRzQLisewKPK"
      },
